{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04191","headline":"同辛簿简仰酬思玄上人林泉四首 三 · 骆宾王","name":"同辛簿简仰酬思玄上人林泉四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林泉恣探历，风景暂裴徊。\n客有迁莺处，人无结驷来。\n聚花如薄雪，沸水若轻雷。\n今日徒招隐，终知异凿坏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}